## Why These Changes

- Modal over navigation: meets requirement to show a popup covering ~80% of the window.
- Mock data: ensures all dashboard features appear consistently, regardless of backend.
- Charts and styles: percent-based bars require explicit parent heights; gradients, borders, and badges improve clarity and appeal.
- Template safety: avoids parser errors and broken builds by using Angular-friendly ternary checks and balanced tags.

